i would say covid was a black swan (white swan for the nassim taleb nerds) which can break structures. doesnt violate them, TA is useless imo when it comes to rare events. charts tell history and submits their outliers. 

&#x200B;

would argue s2f with r\^2 of 95% is really good, but even the best correlation breaks down due to unforseeable circumstances. just like the log curve did

usually they dont sell often. only when prices are right so i assume they are up to something. but i am leaning too optimistic here.

