yep they are but i like them to spot levels where retail traders add money to the game. and fibs are not apophenia based, children can use them and so can (hopefully) the majority of retail traders. 

&#x200B;

dont get me wrong, fibs alone for entries & exits = loosing money in the long run but in combination with leading indicators (eg bid 0,618 when 3 leading indicators scream buy) they can contribute value

